A("Phase seven: what they have in common.",PH(7,"What they have in common",51))
A("Look at the five together. Money you need soon, borrowed money, high fees, panic selling, and all-in bets. They look different, but they share one thing.",I("right",51,"five",icon="cross",items=["Money you need soon","Borrowed money","High fees","Panic selling","All-in bets"],t=["soon","borrowed","fees","panic","all-in"],title="The five"))
A("And none of them is about intelligence. Smart people make these mistakes all the time, because they are driven by emotions: fear, greed, and the fear of missing out.",I("right",58,"chips",**ch(["Fear","warn","fear"],["Greed","coin","greed"],["Fear of missing out","bell","missing"],title="The real driver")))
